# ==============================================================================
# AD-AGENTS-PROJECTS — public repository
#
# This repository is the PUBLIC FACE of the engine. It contains the method,
# the tools and the documentation. It contains NO projects, NO client names,
# NO contracts and NO decision records.
#
# The lines below are not decoration: they are the boundary. Anything that
# looks like a project, a secret, or an internal register is excluded here.
# If you fork this and add work of your own, keep it this way.
# ==============================================================================

# -- Projects ----------------------------------------------------------------
# A project folder is numbered: "1. Project Name" or "01. Project Name".
# The leading digits are
# what the engine uses to recognise a product, and it is exactly what must
# never cross this boundary.
/[0-9]*/
/[0-9]*.*/

# -- Internal registers ------------------------------------------------------
# Contracts, approvals, evidence, decisions, errors and drift are the memory
# of the engine. They name people, clients and failures. They stay local.
/contratti/
/approvazioni/
/evidenze/
/DECISIONI/
/errori/
/drift/
/comunicazioni/
/REQUISITI/
/evals/
/orchestrazione/
/milestone/
/piani/
/BLUEPRINT.md
/sede.yaml

# -- The brain ---------------------------------------------------------------
# The brain SHIPS: the constitution, the ten procedures and the gate are the
# method. What does not ship is the memory: sede.yaml (who the CEO is) and the
# registers below. A brain is rules; memory is made by the person who works.
#
# /.brain/ is therefore NOT excluded. The old line was removed on 2026-11-07:
# without it, a downloaded engine reports "manca .brain/skills/" and cannot
# become a working machine. The brain is checked for client names before every
# publish, because it is authored in a private house.

# -- Study material ----------------------------------------------------------
# Third-party source, data not machinery. Reconstructable, never shipped.
/studio/
/reference/
/notes/

# -- Secrets and credentials -------------------------------------------------
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
.env
.env.*
secrets/
credentials/
.ad-consenso.key
config.local.*

# -- Local state -------------------------------------------------------------
/.cache/
/backup/
/.monitoraggio-*.jsonl
*.log
*.tmp
*.sqlite
*.db

# -- Editor and OS noise -----------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/

# -- Keep the tools ----------------------------------------------------------
# The tools are the engine: they are the reason this repository exists.
!/tools/
!/tools/**
!/tests/
!/tests/**
